## 📌 Introduction
- React is a **JavaScript library** for building user interfaces.  
- Developed by **Facebook (Meta)**, made open-source in **2013**.  
- Used for creating **Single Page Applications (SPAs)**.  
- Works on the concept of **components, virtual DOM, and state management**.  

